legend right
  |= Colour |= Meaning |
  | <back:#FFF3CD>   </back> | App wiring / composition root - read these FIRST |
  | <back:#E8F4FD>   </back> | Cross-cutting concerns, used by nearly everything |
  | <back:#FDEBD0>   </back> | A feature area: the protocol form, and account administration |
  | <back:#D4EDDA>   </back> | Reusable building blocks / pure logic (heavily tested) |
  | <back:#FDF0E3>   </back> | Outside the frontend entirely |
endlegend

@enduml